    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/9b50bea6202e8924e4ac350f903e2984.poster.avif?t=1718733862\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/9b50bea6202e8924e4ac350f903e2984.webm?t=1718733862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Strategic survival</strong>: A unique, single-axis, turn-based combat system where accelerating and breaking lines up your cars with enemy targets.<br></li><li><strong>The power of storms </strong>: Navigate through storms that apply enemy debuffs such as acid rain, heavy wind, hail, and more.<br></li><li><strong>A rogue-lite journey</strong>: Stronger angels spawn deeper into the soul storm, along with powerful new abilities and enhancements.<br></li><li><strong>Prepare your caravan</strong>: Change the arrangement of your caravan to execute different strategies. Each car has unique abilities and strengths. <br></li><li><strong>A concise experience</strong>: A successful run takes ~30-60 minutes to complete. Unlock the True Ending by discovering the nature of the Soul Storm.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/d9055f559b598435d0954b60d45248d7.poster.avif?t=1718733862\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/d9055f559b598435d0954b60d45248d7.webm?t=1718733862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><strong>A turn-based chase across a desolate post-apocalypse. When phantoms descend to destroy your engine, accelerate/break to align your cars and activate your weaponry.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/14138bb8b4f14d9feedbf4196c05538f.webp?t=1718733862\" width=616 height=33 /></span><br>I woke 3 years ago to find myself completely <strong>ALONE</strong>. <br><br>My family was gone, the city empty- everyone vanished without a trace.<br><br>And then one night, while struggling to fall asleep, I <strong>HEARD</strong> them again. A hundred million whispers crying out. <br><br>I looked on the horizon and saw a <strong>STORM OF SOULS</strong> moving towards me, freezing trees and burying everything in its path in snow as black as night.<br><br>Over the last few days I <strong>CONSTRUCTED</strong> a caravan with enough weapons and supplies for me to run for weeks.<br><br>But as the storm crept closer with every passing day, I realized the truth.<br><br>There is no escaping it. I am helpless against the totality of it.<br><br>If there can be any hope, it is to reach the eye itself. To go <strong>THROUGH</strong> the storm.<br><br>I will meet you there.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/1b65e219fec5f17cb9dd385f8b825bf3.webp?t=1718733862\" width=616 height=33 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/9b50bea6202e8924e4ac350f903e2984.poster.avif?t=1718733862\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/9b50bea6202e8924e4ac350f903e2984.webm?t=1718733862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Strategic survival</strong>: A unique, single-axis, turn-based combat system where accelerating and breaking lines up your cars with enemy targets.<br></li><li><strong>The power of storms </strong>: Navigate through storms that apply enemy debuffs such as acid rain, heavy wind, hail, and more.<br></li><li><strong>A rogue-lite journey</strong>: Stronger angels spawn deeper into the soul storm, along with powerful new abilities and enhancements.<br></li><li><strong>Prepare your caravan</strong>: Change the arrangement of your caravan to execute different strategies. Each car has unique abilities and strengths. <br></li><li><strong>A concise experience</strong>: A successful run takes ~30-60 minutes to complete. Unlock the True Ending by discovering the nature of the Soul Storm.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/d9055f559b598435d0954b60d45248d7.poster.avif?t=1718733862\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/d9055f559b598435d0954b60d45248d7.webm?t=1718733862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><strong>A turn-based chase across a desolate post-apocalypse. When phantoms descend to destroy your engine, accelerate/break to align your cars and activate your weaponry.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/14138bb8b4f14d9feedbf4196c05538f.webp?t=1718733862\" width=616 height=33 /></span><br>I woke 3 years ago to find myself completely <strong>ALONE</strong>. <br><br>My family was gone, the city empty- everyone vanished without a trace.<br><br>And then one night, while struggling to fall asleep, I <strong>HEARD</strong> them again. A hundred million whispers crying out. <br><br>I looked on the horizon and saw a <strong>STORM OF SOULS</strong> moving towards me, freezing trees and burying everything in its path in snow as black as night.<br><br>Over the last few days I <strong>CONSTRUCTED</strong> a caravan with enough weapons and supplies for me to run for weeks.<br><br>But as the storm crept closer with every passing day, I realized the truth.<br><br>There is no escaping it. I am helpless against the totality of it.<br><br>If there can be any hope, it is to reach the eye itself. To go <strong>THROUGH</strong> the storm.<br><br>I will meet you there.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764860/extras/1b65e219fec5f17cb9dd385f8b825bf3.webp?t=1718733862\" width=616 height=33 /></span>",
